msgid "Before-and-after evaluation of Klein's Arrow-first inter-task data plane for SQL, batch UDF, embedding, image, and PDF workloads."
msgstr "Klein Arrow-first 跨任务数据面在 SQL、批 UDF、embedding、图像和 PDF 工作负载下的改造前后评测。"

msgid "Arrow-first data-plane evaluation"
msgstr "Arrow-first 数据面评测"

msgid "**Evaluation date:** 2026-07-21"
msgstr "**评测日期：** 2026-07-21"

msgid "**Historical baseline:** clean checkout of `cca02fe`"
msgstr "**历史基线：** `cca02fe` 的干净检出"

msgid "**Candidate:** the source revision containing this report, with Arrow transport enabled by default"
msgstr "**候选版本：** 包含本报告的源代码版本，默认启用 Arrow 传输"

msgid "Executive result"
msgstr "结论摘要"

msgid "The Arrow-first candidate improved measured end-to-end streaming throughput by 5.5 to 6.3 percent over the historical revision. A same-revision transport toggle showed the largest isolated gain, 17.4 percent, for a two-stage embedding batch-UDF pipeline. Existing Ray Data batch SQL remained neutral, and image/PDF workloads were neutral because native decoding, resizing, and rendering dominated their runtime."
msgstr "与历史版本相比，Arrow-first 候选版本在实测中将端到端流式吞吐提高了 5.5% 至 6.3%。同版本传输开关对照中，两段 embedding 批 UDF 管道取得了最大的独立收益，为 17.4%。现有 Ray Data 批 SQL 基本持平；图像/PDF 工作负载也基本持平，因为原生解码、缩放和渲染占据了主要运行时间。"

msgid "The result supports retaining Arrow at real inter-task data boundaries. It does not support forcing Arrow through chained in-process operators or every row-oriented UDF boundary."
msgstr "结果支持在真正的任务间数据边界保留 Arrow，但不支持强制让 Arrow 贯穿进程内算子链或每个逐行 UDF 边界。"

msgid "Scope and method"
msgstr "范围与方法"

msgid "The historical comparison used a clean detached checkout for `cca02fe` and the same Python environment as the candidate. The historical revision already had Python mapping-based columnar passthrough; it was not a pure row-only engine. The controlled comparison ran only the candidate and changed `pipeline.columnar-passthrough.enabled`, which isolates Arrow transport but is not a reconstruction of the historical revision."
msgstr "历史对照使用 `cca02fe` 的干净分离检出，并与候选版本使用相同的 Python 环境。历史版本已经支持基于 Python mapping 的列式透传，并不是纯逐行引擎。受控对照只运行候选版本并切换 `pipeline.columnar-passthrough.enabled`；它能隔离 Arrow 传输的影响，但不是对历史版本的重建。"

