msgid "Serialized sizes use `ray.cloudpickle` as a consistent relative measurement; they are not claimed to be exact Ray Object Store network-byte counts. Arrow mostly removes envelope and Python-object overhead. It cannot compress an already encoded JPEG, WebP, or PDF payload."
