msgid "Negative result: row materialization"
msgstr "负向结果：行物化"

msgid "A local pack, serialize, deserialize, and unbatched-consume microbenchmark exposed the principal remaining risk:"
msgstr "本地打包、序列化、反序列化和非批消费微基准暴露了主要的剩余风险："

