msgid "This conversion is expensive because a columnar batch is materialized back into Python dictionaries. Remote end-to-end SQL still improved because fewer RPC envelopes and cheaper serialization outweighed the conversion, but a small-payload, row-only downstream operator can be a counterexample."
msgstr "该转换代价很高，因为列式批次会重新物化为 Python 字典。远程端到端 SQL 仍有提升，因为更少的 RPC envelope 和更低的序列化成本覆盖了转换开销；但小载荷、纯逐行的下游算子可能成为反例。"

msgid "Decision and follow-up"
msgstr "决策与后续工作"

msgid "Keep Arrow-first transport at actual inter-task boundaries."
msgstr "在真正的任务间边界保留 Arrow-first 传输。"

msgid "Keep chained in-process operators in their native representation."
msgstr "让进程内链接算子保持其原生表示。"

msgid "Prefer batched SQL, vectorized UDFs, and AI tensor pipelines when practical."
msgstr "在可行时优先使用批 SQL、向量化 UDF 和 AI tensor 管道。"

msgid "Treat media transport as neutral until larger multi-node tests demonstrate a benefit."
msgstr "在更大规模的多节点测试证明收益前，将媒体传输视为持平。"

msgid "Add a downstream-aware policy that can bypass Arrow for known small, unbatched row consumers, or provide a cheaper lazy row view."
msgstr "增加下游感知策略：对已知的小型非批逐行消费者绕过 Arrow，或提供成本更低的惰性行视图。"

msgid "Extend future release evaluation with multi-node network throughput, p95/p99 latency, peak worker/Object Store memory, skew, backpressure, and recovery."
msgstr "后续发布评测应扩展到多节点网络吞吐、p95/p99 延迟、worker/Object Store 峰值内存、倾斜、背压和恢复。"

msgid "These measurements justify the current architecture, but they are not a general performance guarantee for arbitrary clusters or user UDFs."
msgstr "这些测量结果支持当前架构，但不构成对任意集群或用户 UDF 的通用性能保证。"

msgid "Review reproducible Klein performance, scalability, reliability, SQL, AI UDF, and multimodal evaluations."
msgstr "查看可复现的 Klein 性能、可扩展性、可靠性、SQL、AI UDF 和多模态评测。"

msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "评测"

msgid "This section records measured Klein behavior against an explicit baseline. It is separate from [Performance tuning](../performance-tuning.md): tuning explains what users can change, while an evaluation report states what was measured, what changed, and whether the evidence supports shipping the change."
msgstr "本栏目记录 Klein 相对明确基线的实测行为。它与[性能调优](../performance-tuning.md)分开：调优说明用户可以改变什么，评测报告则说明测量了什么、发生了什么变化，以及证据是否支持发布该变更。"

msgid "Reporting contract"
msgstr "报告规范"

msgid "Every evaluation report must include:"
msgstr "每份评测报告都必须包含："

msgid "the baseline revision or configuration and the candidate under test;"
msgstr "基线版本或配置，以及被测候选版本；"

msgid "hardware, Python, Ray, PyArrow, and relevant native-library versions;"
msgstr "硬件、Python、Ray、PyArrow 及相关原生库版本；"

msgid "workload shape, input size, topology, concurrency, and non-default options;"
msgstr "工作负载形态、输入规模、拓扑、并发和非默认选项；"

msgid "warm-up policy, sample count, aggregation method, and measured units;"
msgstr "预热策略、样本数量、聚合方法和测量单位；"

msgid "correctness checks performed before accepting performance numbers;"
msgstr "接受性能数据前执行的正确性检查；"

msgid "neutral and negative results alongside improvements;"
msgstr "与提升结果一并报告的持平和负向结果；"

msgid "limits on what the experiment can establish; and"
msgstr "实验结论能力的边界；以及"

msgid "the resulting engineering decision and unresolved follow-up work."
msgstr "由此得出的工程决策和未解决的后续工作。"

msgid "Changing the execution plan, operator topology, data shape, or resource budget creates a different baseline. Reports must not combine those results into one speedup number."
msgstr "改变执行计划、算子拓扑、数据形态或资源预算都会形成不同的基线。报告不得将这些结果合并为一个加速比。"

msgid "Result interpretation"
msgstr "结果解释"

msgid "Classification"
msgstr "分类"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

msgid "Improved"
msgstr "提升"

msgid "The candidate is consistently better for the stated metric and workload."
msgstr "候选版本在指定指标和工作负载上持续优于基线。"

msgid "Neutral"
msgstr "持平"

msgid "The observed difference overlaps run-to-run variation or is too small to support a directional claim."
msgstr "观测差异与运行间波动重叠，或小到不足以支持方向性结论。"

msgid "Regressed"
msgstr "回归"

msgid "The candidate is consistently worse for the stated metric and workload."
msgstr "候选版本在指定指标和工作负载上持续劣于基线。"

msgid "A report with only a few repetitions is an engineering comparison, not a statistical performance guarantee. Release gates should use longer runs, tail-latency percentiles, peak memory, and representative cluster traffic."
msgstr "仅有少量重复次数的报告属于工程对照，并不是统计意义上的性能保证。发布门禁应使用更长时间的运行、尾延迟百分位、峰值内存和具有代表性的集群流量。"

msgid "Planned coverage"
msgstr "规划中的评测范围"

msgid "Future reports belong in this section and should cover distinct concerns:"
msgstr "后续报告应归入本栏目，并分别覆盖以下关注点："

msgid "data-plane serialization, routing, backpressure, and Object Store behavior;"
msgstr "数据面序列化、路由、背压和 Object Store 行为；"

msgid "batch and continuous SQL at increasing scale and skew;"
msgstr "不同规模和倾斜程度下的批 SQL 与连续 SQL；"

msgid "scalar, vectorized, asynchronous, and AI UDF execution;"
msgstr "标量、向量化、异步和 AI UDF 执行；"

msgid "image, PDF, audio, video, and mixed multimodal pipelines;"
msgstr "图像、PDF、音频、视频和混合多模态管道；"

msgid "checkpoint, replay, recovery, and rescaling overhead; and"
msgstr "检查点、重放、恢复和扩缩容开销；以及"

msgid "multi-node scalability, resource efficiency, and cost."
msgstr "多节点可扩展性、资源效率和成本。"
